## 12. Final Review Gate

The last review round was: *"Have you run `cargo fmt` to format the code, and have you run clippy to make sure it's properly linted?"* — plus the checklist in the concise skill. CI automation of fmt/clippy is a recommended follow-up, not a blocker. Clippy nits that appeared in practice: `clone_on_copy` (x5), `identity_op`, `too_many_arguments`.

Reviewers also read your README/docs against your code. Stale claims ("this extends X", fee numbers that no longer match, features that were removed) are review findings. Write docs for the code you actually have.